# The Kingpin of Crime, 1/5: "Whenever you attack, you may pay 2 life. If you do, until end of turn, creatures you control
# with toughness greater than their power assign combat damage equal to their toughness" (CR 119.4, 510.1a). Attacking on
# turn 3 and paying takes Bot1 from 20 to 18 life and Bot2 from 20 to 15 (5 damage, not 1). On turn 5 it attacks again and
# declines: the effect ended at the end of turn 3, so it deals 1, and Bot1 keeps 18.

